From a2c4ffbf526ae5f1b4ee7d44400a299042988077 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Fick <mfick@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 3 Feb 2011 17:47:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Add a Search db object for saving custom searches

The new Search db object allows 4 different types of
saved searches:  user, group, project and site.  All
four types are saved in the same db table.

Change-Id: I2fd0f84f689d36323b0228c1f1ad50838efc40ce
